   "html_text": "Erotic art consists of images centrally aimed at a certain sort of reception (R1). Pornography consists of images centrally aimed at a certain sort of reception (R2). R1 essentially involves attention to form/vehicle/medium/manner, and so entails treating images as in part opaque. R2 essentially excludes attention to form/vehicle/medium/manner, and so entails treating images as wholly transparent. R1 and R2 are incompatible. Hence, nothing can be both erotic art and pornography; or at the least,",
